title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM memory
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check shows the memory assigned to a running VM and, if the guest tools
 report it, the memory used inside the guest. Levels on the in-guest usage
 can be configured. Data comes from the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer VM Memory} per VM.
